[aimspice]
[description]
942
Inverter Simulation
.include p18_cmos_models_tt.inc

.param L_swipe=0.36U

*Inverter 
*MP1 OUT A VDD VDD PMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U

*MN1 OUT A  0   0  NMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U

*--------

*Inverter NMOS stacked
MP1 OUT A VDD VDD PMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U

MN1 OUT A  TS  0  NMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U
MN2 TS  A  0   0  NMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U

*--------

*Inverter Double Stacked
*MP1 TSP A VDD VDD PMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U
*MP2 OUT A TSP VDD PMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U

*MN1 OUT A TSN  0  NMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U
*MN2 TSN A  0   0  NMOS L={L_swipe} W=0.36U
*finn ut av hvorfor 0.36U
*--------

*Voltage sources
VDD VDD 0 1.8
V_A  A  0 1.8




*--------
*til senere simuleringer
*MP1 n1 A VDD VDD PMOS L=0.5U W=10U
*MP2 OUT B n1 VDD PMOS L=0.5U W=10U

*MN1 OUT A n2 0 NMOS L=0.5U W=10U
*MN2 n2 A 0 0 NMOS L=0.5U W=10U

*MN3 OUT B n3 0 NMOS L=0.5U W=10U
*MN4 OUT B 0 0 NMOS L=0.5U W=10U
*V_B B 0 1


